7\\text{-}coideal} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcFilter7Coideal}_S(X,\\mathcal H)\\leftrightarrow\\left(\n\\mathcal H\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land X\\in\\mathcal H\\land\\emptyset\\notin\\mathcal H\\land\n\\forall A\\in\\mathcal H\\;\\forall B\\subseteq X\\;(A\\subseteq B\\to B\\in\\mathcal H)\\land\n\\forall A,B\\subseteq X\\;(A\\cup B\\in\\mathcal H\\to A\\in\\mathcal H\\lor B\\in\\mathcal H)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC filter definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\mathcal H\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcFilter7Coideal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter7\\text{-}coideal} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcFilter7Coideal}_S(X,\\mathcal H)\\leftrightarrow\\left(\n\\mathcal H\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land X\\in\\mathcal H\\land\\emptyset\\notin\\mathcal H\\land\n\\forall A\\in\\mathcal H\\;\\forall B\\subseteq X\\;(A\\subseteq B\\to B\\in\\mathcal H)\\land\n\\forall A,B\\subseteq X\\;(A\\cup B\\in\\mathcal H\\to A\\in\\mathcal H\\lor B\\in\\mathcal H)\\right)","display":true}],"bytes":849,"backlinks":[{"id":"f68edd91fed9964b","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcFilter7Coideal}_S$ (coideal predicate, see [[../batch02/58-df-zfc-filter7-coideal.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1913","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-filter7-coideal.md|58-df-zfc-filter7-coideal]]（batch02）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3"]}